WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:06.140
In the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit, amen.

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:14.020
The reading from the Sinaxadion for September 11 on which we commemorate our righteous

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:24.050
mother Theodora of Alexandria, on the 11th of the month we celebrate the memory of our Holy

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:32.590
Mother Theodora of Alexandria, which is most evidently true of the ten holy women renowned

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:40.270
in the Church for having led the ascetic life disguised in monasteries of men.

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:48.750
Saint Theodora, who lived in Alexandria in the reign of Emperor Zino in the years 474 through

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:52.590
491, is one of these women.

00:00:52.590 --> 00:01:00.150
She was married to a devout and respectable man called Bavnotheos, but one day, led on by

00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:04.430
the devil, she committed adultery.

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:11.510
No sooner had she sinned than she was so afflicted in conscience that she dared not to return

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:17.390
home, but felt a burning desire to do penance without delay.

00:01:17.390 --> 00:01:25.270
So, dressing as a man and calling herself Theodore, she asked to be admitted as a novice

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:27.830
in a neighboring monastery.

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:34.710
The abbot, supposing her to be a unic and seeing how eager she was to set out on the path

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:41.910
of repentance straight away accepted her and clothed her in the angelic habit.

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:48.510
For the space of two years, Saint Theodora showed an ardent zeal in the performance of every

00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:55.790
ascetic labor, doing the most menial tasks and spending the nights in tears and fervent

00:01:55.790 --> 00:02:04.150
prayers to the Lord to forgive her sin and to restore in her the grace of chastity.

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:10.990
Her manner of life edified the brethren but greatly angered the devil who saw his pray

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:18.310
escaping him, but this wolfish enemy of the good would not acknowledge himself defeated

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:23.910
and he made use of some jealous monks to put it about that the youthful Theodore had

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:28.910
committed fornication with a woman of a nearby village.

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:34.510
They even brought his reputed child to the gate of the monastery.

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:38.390
Theodore was silent before her accusers.

00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:44.870
She did not want to reveal her true identity and took what happened as a chastisement

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:47.070
willed by God.

00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:53.510
She was expelled from the monastery for seven years and took the child with her as if it

00:02:53.510 --> 00:02:55.630
were her own.

00:02:55.630 --> 00:03:03.870
She settled in a little hut not far off where in extreme poverty she endured summer heat

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:11.550
and winter cold and many fold temptations of devils until at the completion of her years

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:17.950
of exclusion she was allowed to rejoin the brethren.

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:25.530
Upon her return, far from resting from her labors Theodore increased her vigils, fasts

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:32.430
and prayers, showing an obedience and long suffering even greater than before.

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:39.030
She brought the child with her, teaching him how to acquire the holy evangelical virtues

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:46.350
and unceasing prayers so that he truly became her son according to the Spirit.

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:53.590
When he had given him a final word of admonishment, she fell asleep in peace.

00:03:53.590 --> 00:04:02.550
At that moment the abbot saw in a vision a woman clothed in shining raiment taken up into

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:10.110
the air to join the choir of the righteous and of the saints.

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:16.290
Then they all wept as they realized how far they had been mistaken in her and glorified

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:24.290
God who had wrought so great a wonder for living disguised among men and surpassing them

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:26.490
in her ascetic labors.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:33.410
She was healed of carnal passion through struggling directly against fleshly temptations so that

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:43.100
while still clothed in the body she attained the passionlessness and purity of the angels.

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:50.780
Through the prayers of our holy fathers, O Lord, Jesus Christ our God, have mercy on us and save us.
